[Trigger]
Name	ferns
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	My lord, the Mold Pit is rich in gold and thin in guards, and the Mud Fists of Brackenford have heard about the gold. You have gold to spend, so spend it on rooms before they arrive.
Action	objectiveid	1	brackenford-o01	Defeat the raid and its leader.
Action	objectiveid	1	brackenford-o02	Build a dormitory.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	bedsReady
Mode	once
Cond	room	1	Dormitory	1
Action	message	1	Beds at last. The creatures from the old portal will want food as well.
